    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Namespaces names are strings of characters that can be used as namespaces names. Such names may be validated with the following regex: ``/^(?:[a-zA-Z_\\x80-\\xff][a-zA-Z_\\x80-\\xff0-9]*)(?:\\\\[a-zA-Z_\\x80-\\xff][a-zA-Z_\\x80-\\xff]*)*$/``.\n\nIn particular, namespaces names accept ``\\`` character, and allows vast ranges of Unicode characters.",
    "code": "<?php\n\nnamespace A\\B {}\n\nnamespace \u6211\\\u662f\\PHP {}\n\n?>",
